{"asset_key":"ep1/quest_story_11114090","episode":"ep1","category":"quest_story","story_id":"11114090","schema_version":1,"lang":"kr","texts":{"say:1:1111409001:0":{"text":"신이시여... 고해합니다. 이웃집 초코보 알을 훔치고... 그 집 지붕에 구멍을 뚫은 것도 전부 저였어요...","source_cn":"神明大人……我承认，我偷过邻居家的陆行鸟蛋……他家房顶...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x33332985CD3EF799","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:2:1111409002:0":{"text":"제가 다 잘못했습니다... 부디 석양의 신 곁으로 갈 수 있는 자격을 빼앗지 말아 주세요...","source_cn":"还请您……千万别剥夺我去残阳神身边的资格啊！我愿意认错……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x1A24F5FED8D92071","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1111409003:0":{"text":"무슨 헛소리지... 머리를 다치기라도 한 걸까요?","source_cn":"胡言乱语……他看着伤得不轻，脑子都受影响了。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x990ED0F6EEB9BFF7","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1111409004:1":{"text":"이 아저씨 너무 약해 보여. 이거라도 먹여야 할 것 같아.","source_cn":"这位叔叔很虚弱，他需要吃下这个。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x5CFE9BC9CD57BBF6","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:8:1111409004":{"text":"이 아저씨 너무 약해 보여. 이거라도 먹여야 할 것 같아.","source_cn":"这位叔叔很虚弱，他需要吃下这个。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x5CFE9BC9CD57BBF6","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:9:1111409005:1":{"text":"먹을 수 있는 거.","source_cn":"是能吃的东西。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x470D6929922E5C6A","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:10:1111409006:0":{"text":"잠깐! 이건 진흙을 섞어서 만든 잡초 경단 같은데?! 이런 걸 먹었단 큰일 나!","source_cn":"等等！这东西像混着泥巴捏成的草团，人吃了要出事的！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xDE59AB2AE0F01BC3","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:11:1111409007:0":{"text":"이건 안탄드라 언니가 알려준 거야! 먹으면 배도 부르고 해독이나 치료도 할 수 있단 말이야!","source_cn":"这可是安丹姐姐教我做的团子！不止能填饱肚子，还能解毒治病呢！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x19825E653DCA932C","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:13:1111409008:1":{"text":"사트라나, 이건 여행 중에 만난 한 노인이 알려준 거야.","source_cn":"萨忒娜，我在旅途中遇到过一位老先生，这团子是他教我做的。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xDF36DB8CD9C9B960","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:14:1111409009:1":{"text":"특수한 붉은 흙과 약초를 섞어서 만든 건데, 위급한 상황에서 유용하게 쓸 수 있어.","source_cn":"用特殊的细腻红土混合草药搓制而成，在情况紧急的时候能派...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xFE69751113794EC9","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:15:1111409010:1":{"text":"정말 괜찮은 건가요...","source_cn":"真的没问题吗……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xBAF31FCD1FE45A14","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:16:1111409011:1":{"text":"안탄드라 언니, 봐봐! 사트라나가 언니를 안 믿는 거 같아!","source_cn":"安丹姐姐，你看，萨忒娜不相信你！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xF64A9AEEBF27257B","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:17:1111409012:1":{"text":"그런 거 아니고! 내가 의심하는 건 그 노인이라고! 안탄드라는 사람을 너무 쉽게 믿으니까!","source_cn":"我不是这个意思！我是怀疑那位来历不明的老先生，谁叫安丹...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x6995F3332BB70EDD","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:18:1111409013:1":{"text":"나도 먹어봤는데 아무 일 없었어.","source_cn":"我自己也曾服用过这团子，很安全。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xDE39A6E5D332D5B9","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:19:1111409014:1":{"text":"그래요. 당신이 그렇게 말한다면...","source_cn":"好吧，既然你都这么说了……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x3CB4EC1C9948CE07","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:20:1111409015:1":{"text":"아저씨한테 경단을 먹여 드렸어! 안탄드라 언니, 나 잘했지?","source_cn":"我喂叔叔吃下团子咯！安丹姐姐，我是不是做得很好？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x1CFB08B9FBCC61C8","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:21:1111409016:1":{"text":"우리 카이, 이제 다른 사람을 챙길 줄도 알고, 다 컸네.","source_cn":"卡卡已经是能够照顾别人的大孩子了。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x24744A4BA927E4FF","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:22:1111409017:1":{"text":"히히힛! 신난다! 언니한테 또 칭찬받았다!","source_cn":"嘿嘿！安丹姐姐又夸我啦。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x918788B89B8E94E1","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:23:1111409018:0":{"text":"...쳇.","source_cn":"……哼。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xDE03C0C9504D33BD","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"narration:27:1111409019:0":{"text":"얼마 후...","source_cn":"一段时间后……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x9FE836DB92391A38","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:29:1111409020:0":{"text":"이제 좀 괜찮아졌어?","source_cn":"现在感觉好些了吗？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x1CB6B10031532659","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:31:1111409021:1":{"text":"세상에... 눈 뜨자마자 본 게 이토록 아리따운 미인이라니... 신이 나를 구하러 보내주신 미인인가...","source_cn":"没想到……一睁开眼，竟然能看到你这般美丽的女性……是神...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xCE76E1165EA56738","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:33:1111409022:1":{"text":"그 손 저리 안 치워요? 누굴 만지려는 거예요!","source_cn":"拿开你的手！不准摸她！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x85FA181250F870D1","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:34:1111409023:1":{"text":"으앗! 미, 미안... 나도 모르게...","source_cn":"哎哟！对、对不起……我这是情不自禁……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xD7CD357B29B1E73C","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:35:1111409024:1":{"text":"됐어요, 됐어! 정신이 들었으면 얼른 떠나세요. 우리도 갈 길이 바빠서 당신을 더 돌봐줄 수가 없어요.","source_cn":"行了行了……你要是已经恢复了，就赶快离开这里，我们忙着...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x9278C5A6E64842BE","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:36:1111409025:1":{"text":"뭐라고...? 여기서 더 이동하겠다는 말이야? 안 돼! 너무 위험해!","source_cn":"什么……你们还要向深处走吗？太危险了！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xE141372CB3750108","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:37:1111409026:1":{"text":"우리는 반드시 가야 해.","source_cn":"我们必须前进。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x07DC449067AF61CF","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:38:1111409027:1":{"text":"환각 면역 능력이 있다고 해도... 그 거미줄은 절대 통과 못 할 거야! 사람까지 죽이는 거미라고!","source_cn":"就算你们能抵抗那些幻觉……也根本不可能走过蛛网戈壁！那...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x08188885E490C2AD","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:39:1111409028:1":{"text":"거미라... 알았어. 알려줘서 고마워.","source_cn":"蜘蛛吗……知道了，感谢你的提醒。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x62E22A669D200D7B","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:40:1111409029:1":{"text":"아... 정말 가야겠다면 그 거미를 반드시 조심해야 해!","source_cn":"啊……你们真的要去吗？千万要当心那些蜘蛛！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC8A69F93A074B22F","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice:8:0:1":{"text":"그게 뭐야?","source_cn":"那是什么？","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0xF4E7DF0F52CA4FBB","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"그게 뭐야?","female":"그게 뭐야?","variant_male_record_index":"63692","variant_female_record_index":"63693","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:意